  "A carbon monoxide alarm means leave now. Warn everyone in the house, go outside to fresh air, and call 911 from outside. Don't go back in until the emergency services say it's safe.": "Carbon monoxide alarm? Go outside and call 911 from outside.",
  "A carbon monoxide alarm means leave now. Warn everyone in the house, go outside to fresh air, and call 911 from outside. Don't go back in until the emergency services say it's safe. In danger: call 911. Smell gas? Leave the building first, then call 911 or your gas utility's emergency line from outside.": "Carbon monoxide alarm? Go outside and call 911 from outside.",
  "A carbon monoxide alarm means leave now. Warn everyone in the house, go outside, and call 112 from outside. Don't go back in until the emergency services say it's safe.": "Carbon monoxide alarm? Go outside and call 112 from outside.",
